Draconid_Text_MayCallUniform1::
	.string "MAY: …Oh. It's you.\p"
	.string "I only registered you to keep tabs\n"
	.string "on MAGMA.\p"
	.string "So where are you headed next?\n"
	.string "…Fine. I'll find out anyway.$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallUniform2::
	.string "MAY: I heard you beat WATTSON.\p"
	.string "Does MAGMA hand out a prize for\n"
	.string "every BADGE, or what?\p"
	.string "Don't call me just to brag.$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallUniform3::
	.string "MAY: MT. CHIMNEY was shaking the\n"
	.string "other day. You could see the smoke\l"
	.string "from here.\p"
	.string "If MAGMA hurt anyone up there, I'll\n"
	.string "find out.\p"
	.string "…Were you there, {PLAYER}?$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallUniform4::
	.string "MAY: You beat my dad.\p"
	.string "He says you battled fair. He almost\n"
	.string "sounded proud.\p"
	.string "I don't get you, {PLAYER}. I really\n"
	.string "don't.$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallUniform5::
	.string "MAY: About the WEATHER INSTITUTE…\p"
	.string "I did that for the scientists, okay?\p"
	.string "So don't go telling MAGMA about it.$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallUniform6::
	.string "MAY: BRENDAN and I will stop you\n"
	.string "next time.\p"
	.string "We'll be ready for you. Both of us.$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallUniform7::
	.string "MAY: My dad called. He asked if I'd\n"
	.string "seen you.\p"
	.string "He still thinks there's some good in\n"
	.string "you.\p"
	.string "…I told him I'd let him know.$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallUniform8::
	.string "MAY: Everyone in MOSSDEEP keeps\n"
	.string "looking out at the sea.\p"
	.string "AQUA took a submarine, and MAGMA's\n"
	.string "everywhere.\p"
	.string "Whatever you're part of, it's\n"
	.string "getting worse. I just want it to\l"
	.string "stop.$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallRevealed1::
	.string "MAY: Hi, {PLAYER}! Guess who's not\n"
	.string "mad at you anymore?\p"
	.string "Go get JUAN's BADGE. I'll be cheering\n"
	.string "for you!$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallRevealed2::
	.string "MAY: Eight BADGES! That's all of\n"
	.string "them!\p"
	.string "The POKéMON LEAGUE is in\n"
	.string "EVER GRANDE CITY.\p"
	.string "It's east of SOOTOPOLIS. Climb the\n"
	.string "waterfall there, then go through\l"
	.string "VICTORY ROAD.\p"
	.string "You can do it!$"

Draconid_Text_MayCallRevealed3::
	.string "MAY: CHAMPION {PLAYER}! Everyone in\n"
	.string "HOENN knows your name now.\p"
	.string "Whatever's going on with the sky, I\n"
	.string "know you'll handle it.\p"
	.string "Then come by the LAB. BRENDAN and I\n"
	.string "want a rematch!$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallUniform1::
	.string "BRENDAN: Yeah? What do you want?\p"
	.string "MAY says we have to keep an eye on\n"
	.string "you. So that's what I'm doing.\p"
	.string "If MAGMA's planning something,\n"
	.string "you'd better not be in it.$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallUniform2::
	.string "BRENDAN: WINONA says you battled\n"
	.string "her fair and square.\p"
	.string "Doesn't change what you're wearing,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}.$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallUniform3::
	.string "BRENDAN: Two of us, and you still\n"
	.string "won.\p"
	.string "Don't get cocky. Next time I'll be\n"
	.string "ready for you.$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallUniform4::
	.string "BRENDAN: I heard MAGMA took an ORB\n"
	.string "from MT. PYRE.\p"
	.string "Those old folks guarded it their\n"
	.string "whole lives.\p"
	.string "…Tell me you weren't there, {PLAYER}.$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallUniform5::
	.string "BRENDAN: I've got nothing to say to\n"
	.string "you.\p"
	.string "STEVEN says you're the strongest\n"
	.string "MAGMA grunt he's ever faced.\p"
	.string "…So why waste it on them?$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallRevealed1::
	.string "BRENDAN: Hey, {PLAYER}. …So, uh. Go\n"
	.string "beat JUAN.\p"
	.string "If you lose to him after all that,\n"
	.string "I'm never letting you hear the end\l"
	.string "of it.$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallRevealed2::
	.string "BRENDAN: All eight BADGES, huh?\n"
	.string "Figures.\p"
	.string "VICTORY ROAD starts past the\n"
	.string "waterfall in EVER GRANDE CITY.\p"
	.string "The trainers in there are no joke.\n"
	.string "Don't lose before you reach the\l"
	.string "LEAGUE!$"

Draconid_Text_BrendanCallRevealed3::
	.string "BRENDAN: CHAMPION, huh? …Man,\n"
	.string "you're strong.\p"
	.string "Once things calm down, come by my\n"
	.string "dad's LAB.\p"
	.string "MAY and I have a rematch waiting\n"
	.string "for you.$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallUniform1::
	.string "WALLY: …Oh. It's you.\p"
	.string "I'm training every day now. For the\n"
	.string "next time I see MAGMA.\p"
	.string "…For the next time I see you,\n"
	.string "{PLAYER}.$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallUniform2::
	.string "WALLY: People in VERDANTURF say\n"
	.string "MT. CHIMNEY nearly erupted.\p"
	.string "The smoke reached all the way here.\n"
	.string "I could hardly breathe.\p"
	.string "Was that MAGMA? …Was that you?$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallUniform3::
	.string "WALLY: I lost to you again at the\n"
	.string "GYM.\p"
	.string "My POKéMON didn't give up, though.\n"
	.string "So I won't either.$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallUniform4::
	.string "WALLY: I'm heading for VICTORY ROAD\n"
	.string "soon.\p"
	.string "If MAGMA ever comes near\n"
	.string "EVER GRANDE, I'll be waiting.$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallRevealed1::
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}! I heard about\n"
	.string "SOOTOPOLIS.\p"
	.string "…I'm sorry for everything I said. I\n"
	.string "didn't know.\p"
	.string "I'll be waiting at VICTORY ROAD.\n"
	.string "Let's have a real battle this time!$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallRevealed2::
	.string "WALLY: You're too strong, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "I'm going to keep training with\n"
	.string "GALLADE. Someday I'll catch up to\l"
	.string "you!$"

Draconid_Text_WallyCallRevealed3::
	.string "WALLY: CHAMPION {PLAYER}! My uncle\n"
	.string "can't stop talking about it.\p"
	.string "He says he always knew. …He didn't,\n"
	.string "but that's okay.$"
